35-72
00:50:33.363 --> 00:50:37.054
Check the restored controls before reading any result.

35-73
00:50:37.234 --> 00:50:43.762
The model is one-parameter Margules, A is three, and the feed is zero
point one two.

35-74
00:50:43.942 --> 00:50:48.528
The old result cards may still describe the previous calculation.

35-75
00:50:48.708 --> 00:50:52.463
Restore does not run this calculator automatically.

35-76
00:50:52.643 --> 00:50:55.288
Now click Find equilibrium again.

35-77
00:50:55.468 --> 00:51:09.228
The fresh result returns to metastable, two liquids, with beta
fraction about zero point zero five seven four and energy decrease
about zero point zero zero eight two one six.

35-78
00:51:09.408 --> 00:51:14.294
This completes the save, reopen, restore and recalculate cycle.

35-79
00:51:14.474 --> 00:51:21.983
Keep the three cases, your independent balances and your explanation
